{"ORBIT", "speed", R"RASGO(The speed of the sky (SPEED 1: planet 1 goes round in ~2 s on a circular orbit).)RASGO"},
{"OSC", "drift", R"RASGO(Slow, correlated walk in the tuning (±half a semitone at most).)RASGO"},
{"OSC", "fine", R"RASGO(Fine tuning in cents (±100).)RASGO"},
