{"OSC", "in:pitch", R"RASGO(1 V/oct CV — adds to FREQ.)RASGO"},
{"OSC", "in:pwm", R"RASGO(CV that adds to PW.)RASGO"},
{"OSC", "in:sub_cv", R"RASGO(CV on the SUB divisor: +1/15 V raises one divisor (1 V = the whole range). A TURING or SEQUENCE here walks the bass through the subharmonic series. The change lands on the oscillator's cycle, click-free.)RASGO"},
