{"PENDULUM", "in:kick", R"RASGO(Each trigger pushes the lower arm: more energy, more chaos.)RASGO"},
{"PENDULUM", "in:speed_cv", R"RASGO(CV on speed: each +1 doubles it.)RASGO"},
